# Generated outputs are never pushed: images, arrays, rendered pages and result records.
# Source pages and input or provenance JSON that code reads are listed as exceptions.
*.png
*.npy
*.html
*.json
# Data acquisition and geometry records may be versioned, except raw controlled-scene bundles.
!data/**/*.json
data/controlled_scene/input/
