.worktrees/

# Papers and lecture slides are third-party copyright; they stay local. READMEs name each source.
*.pdf

# The committed test recording (public TUM data) and its golden outputs.
!tests/fixtures/**
# Model weights stay local; the manifest records their source, licence and hashes.
models/*
!models/manifest.toml
!models/README.md
